Z||000005||Raydar||09-25-2000||11:07 PM||||Also heard rumors of a maximum of four Formulas built with <I>fastback</I> bodies. Supposedly, they ran out of notchback body clips while they still had four Formulas nearly completed. When GM got wind of what was happening, they supposedly ordered the cars destroyed. Some enterprising factory personnel hid the cars until the Gustapo went away.<BR>I read a story about this in one of the FOCOA magazines, about a year ago. They even had a pic. <BR>Don't know how true the story is, though.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR>88 Formula T-Top <BR>88 Coupe (soon to receive transplant.)<BR>88 "pretzeled" Formula <P>Out of my mind.<BR>Back in five minutes.||||reg||1
